WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.000
A developer just killed the Claude code token problem for free.

00:04.000 --> 00:09.360
Now, your $20 plan is just as powerful as the $100 plan. Here's how.

00:09.360 --> 00:12.960
The problem is this, every time you start a new Claude code session,

00:12.960 --> 00:17.280
it re reads your entire code base, every file, every function,

00:17.280 --> 00:20.640
thousands of tokens gone before you even ask a question.

00:20.640 --> 00:23.840
This is why you're burning through tokens and wasting your money.

00:23.840 --> 00:28.560
But this tool, graphify, fixes it. First, run this new tool,

00:28.640 --> 00:33.200
then watch as it reads your entire code base. What happens is it builds a full

00:33.200 --> 00:37.680
knowledge graph of everything inside every connection, every relationship. Now,

00:37.680 --> 00:41.280
during your next session, Claude won't reread all those files.

00:41.280 --> 00:46.160
It simply navigates the new graph, saving you a ridiculous amount of tokens.

00:46.160 --> 00:48.800
Comment, graphify for my complete setup guide.

